  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "真相"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<iframe frameborder=\"0\" height=\"700\" marginheight=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" src=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vTJXnXGqCLKpFwixldE-NHbTMwZRrVXfT7tcbhnCy9pWlnRsl-ShPfa3dptU32wcYkRpUViDf2F86ut/pub?embedded=true\" width=\"700\"></iframe>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b></b></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgu09nNVKFo4IzmwyfjV2oRLPNRhQNc7wNsVEVivu4RxTPX6Oi0_2rhfIr2yqWcX8vnS168nF0XoY0ufObLjRl-eT3t6CDs-awNnmSSfqB9UuhSFlIRL9M9V-PdsmUtnSLzxrT6NOQzYvCEjQ45zRHkeZypujmhaxXMEqBSurDVtgaI3h-PjUZ23M7B1A/s657/%E9%98%BFK%E8%B3%9E%E5%BE%BD%E7%AB%A0_%E9%BB%83%E9%87%91.jpg\" style=\"clear: left; float: left; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"657\" data-original-width=\"457\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgu09nNVKFo4IzmwyfjV2oRLPNRhQNc7wNsVEVivu4RxTPX6Oi0_2rhfIr2yqWcX8vnS168nF0XoY0ufObLjRl-eT3t6CDs-awNnmSSfqB9UuhSFlIRL9M9V-PdsmUtnSLzxrT6NOQzYvCEjQ45zRHkeZypujmhaxXMEqBSurDVtgaI3h-PjUZ23M7B1A/s320/%E9%98%BFK%E8%B3%9E%E5%BE%BD%E7%AB%A0_%E9%BB%83%E9%87%91.jpg\" width=\"223\" /></a></b></span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>夏玉華</b></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">今年新冠肺炎疫情嚴重，規台灣進入三級警戒，bē-tàng去學校上課，阿母招阮姊妹仔同齊整理舊相簿。我lió著一張小妹剃光頭ê相片，我tsiok好玄，問阿母講：「小妹tsit-má頭鬃tsiah濟，tang時剃光頭，我哪ē m̄知？」阿母kā小妹攬--leh，目箍紅紅喉tīnn，開始講hit段往事……。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Hit-tsūn我iáu leh讀幼稚園，歇睏日kap以早sio仝，阿母kā我載去阿媽兜。「Ài乖乖聽阿媽ê話，知--無？」日頭落山，我徛踮門口埕niau-niau-siòng，suah等無人來載我tńg--去。眠床頂囥一軀我tiānn穿ê睏衫，我看m̄是勢，就大聲háu。「阿母kám是無beh ti̍h--我--ah？」阿媽緊kā我mooh--leh，我phak tī阿媽ê胸前，哭kah sau聲、忝kah睏--去。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">就án-ne我開始蹛tī hia，逐工目睭peh金我就háu beh揣阿母，hit个時tsūn，我感覺家己bē輸hōo爸母放sak ê孤兒。便若想著早前規家伙仔鬥陣ê快樂畫面，我kan-na ē-tàng偷偷仔流目屎。「是按怎in beh kā我phiann踮tsia，kám講in真正無愛--我，kan-na愛小妹？我到底做m̄-tio̍h啥mih代誌？」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">有一工，阿媽tshuân一鼎芳kòng-kòng ê雞湯，阿公講：「行！Tsiūnn車。」「阿公，你kám是beh tshuā我去tshit-thô？」阿公微微仔笑m̄ kā我應。「乖孫--ê，到位--ah！緊落車。」「E̋！Lán m̄是beh去tshit-thô？阿公，你哪ē tshuā我來病院？」我gōng-gōng tuè tī in後壁kho̍k-kho̍k行，行到一間病房門口停--落-來。門一下開--開，我驚一tiô。「阿爸kap阿母哪ē掛喙am？小妹哪ē倒tī病床？原本是白phau-phau幼mī-mī ê小妹，哪ē瘦kah賰一枝骨？」我看了tsiok m̄甘，目屎直直輾--落-來，阿母行倚--來，目睭ham-ham，用伊燒lō ê手kā我mua--leh。我tsiah知影，阿爸kap阿母為著beh照顧致著血癌ê小妹，姑不將tsiah kā我交hōo阿媽照顧。原來iáu是真愛--我，我啥mi̍h to m̄知，就怪--in、討厭--in，實在tsiânn不孝。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tsit擺整理舊相簿，我tsiah知tsín生kah kau-tshiâng大漢ê小妹，bat去鬼門關se̍h一輾tńg--來。感謝天公伯tsiah-nī疼惜--阮，還我一个健康活潑ê小妹，謝天謝地。&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><!--more--><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiU6IZ9_ubI-BaZ5Vr_CEVjrcfGdkpdEzN1VoLU93o92pWp3AGMcgpp1YJ5mfom_h2Z0x-jps__dtIz_rB6K4MZSs9sXd6HIrIrghPeyhGlvcIadf7v4H-FCMLR38YA2d1QWmGkZiGTf6IEKdOPfx5znAxEWZbE0H-h8ekwO2kIc6JY4zmLWaJ8CBHH1w/s4032/%E5%A4%8F%E7%8E%89%E8%8F%AF.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3024\" data-original-width=\"4032\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiU6IZ9_ubI-BaZ5Vr_CEVjrcfGdkpdEzN1VoLU93o92pWp3AGMcgpp1YJ5mfom_h2Z0x-jps__dtIz_rB6K4MZSs9sXd6HIrIrghPeyhGlvcIadf7v4H-FCMLR38YA2d1QWmGkZiGTf6IEKdOPfx5znAxEWZbE0H-h8ekwO2kIc6JY4zmLWaJ8CBHH1w/w640-h480/%E5%A4%8F%E7%8E%89%E8%8F%AF.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">倒手爿--ê是作者夏玉華</td></tr></tbody></table><br /><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg_vgYrk4hW-sy8lf_5007WQ2siEEHHQ-foS1E7yvfJKkirMC65Z5fzUrVV8MZeP7zzCt4Z9HTCRAvUNg9b8YhdCrfb-DQtLigzgbskNb4RX-s2gWOWqG8Lsg3ZlnKrEgXgXlwx5ec7HJujVca-CSxF1tpZ-JdSCgYyVhWG-vtyNpFz9FIdFS_qIemDTg/s1424/336%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg_vgYrk4hW-sy8lf_5007WQ2siEEHHQ-foS1E7yvfJKkirMC65Z5fzUrVV8MZeP7zzCt4Z9HTCRAvUNg9b8YhdCrfb-DQtLigzgbskNb4RX-s2gWOWqG8Lsg3ZlnKrEgXgXlwx5ec7HJujVca-CSxF1tpZ-JdSCgYyVhWG-vtyNpFz9FIdFS_qIemDTg/w450-h640/336%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhqRePru2J45_UBHmpYULp5SYEPMMMfBnuX01IHn1vR4LupTAZW21p09z8JTpR61SOJPwAmSK5jNDzf